dialogue.garde-du-bourg.halte = Halt.
dialogue.garde-du-bourg.halte.partir = I am leaving.
dialogue.garde-du-bourg.halte.pourquoi = Why?
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.accepte-replique = Hm. You have nerve, and that is what the crowd loves. Your name is on the list — may the Mark keep you.
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.deja-inscrit = Your name is already on the list. Come back when the stands are full.
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.demande = The champions' list is closed for the season. Unless you give me a good reason to reopen it.
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.demande.convaincre = The stands crave fresh blood. I am what they are waiting for.
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.demande.renoncer = Too bad. Another season.
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.marque = Before every bout, a priest traces the Heroic Mark on each fighter. When the last blow falls, it raises everyone back up — winners and losers alike. Only Feargus fights without it.
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.presentation = Halt, traveller. You stand at the gates of the Arena of the Future. Here, two sides settle what a war would otherwise settle — and nobody leaves feet first. What are you looking for?
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.presentation.inscription = I want to fight in the arena.
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.presentation.marque = Nobody dies? How is that possible?
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.presentation.partir = Nothing. I was only passing through.
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.refuse-replique = Fine speech. The list stays closed, and so does my patience.
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.retour = You again. Still curious about the Mark, or do you finally want to fight?
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.retour.inscription = Put my name among the champions.
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.retour.marque = Tell me about the Mark again.
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.retour.partir = I will be back.
dialogue.heraut-d-essai.speaker = The test herald
dialogue.maitre-d-essai.defi = The dungeon rats await you on the sand. Shall we?
dialogue.maitre-d-essai.defi.combattre = Let them loose.
dialogue.maitre-d-essai.defi.partir = Not today.
dialogue.maitre-d-essai.speaker = The test arena master
dialogue.garde-du-bourg.pourquoi = The ward is closed.
